{"ex-3A01-1":{"id":"ex-3A01-1","chapter":"3A01","number":1,"title":"應用反射定律","question":"<p>光線射向平面鏡（圖 a），入射線與鏡面的夾角是 22°。求反射角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>，並完成光線圖。</p><p>圖 a</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/a69ac40b31b87e2c3d6707a4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:322.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是入射線與法線的夾角（圖 b）。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 90° – 22° = 68° 根據反射定律，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 68° 圖 c 顯示完整的光線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/82db537e11fafde95ccd999a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:538.0px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49999511718761,557.6491,196.9833984375],"text":"例 題 1 應用反射定律\r\n光線射向平面鏡（圖 a），入射線與鏡面的夾角是 22°。求反射角 r，\r\n並完成光線圖。\r\n22° 圖 a\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,196.9833984375,557.6491,392.7559951171875],"text":"題 解\r\ni 是入射線與法線的夾角（圖 b）。\r\ni = 90° – 22° = 68°\r\n根據反射定律，r = i = 68°\r\n圖 c 顯示完整的光線圖。\r\n22°\r\ni\r\n圖 b\r\n22°\r\n68° 68°\r\n圖 c\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-2":{"id":"ex-3A01-2","chapter":"3A01","number":2,"title":"繪畫反射線","question":"<p>在下列各情況中，各有光線射向平面鏡。試就每種情況繪畫法線和反射線。</p><p>(a) (b) (c)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/24ea75f16f755e855ea5be1f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:525.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/eeee3d8a336f9a0a1979ac92.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:525.0px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,404.82889511718747,557.4491,600.1448974609375],"text":"例 題 2 繪畫反射線\r\n在下列各情況中，各有光線射向平面鏡。試就每種情況繪畫法線和反\r\n射線。\r\n(a) (b) (c)\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,600.1448974609375,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) (b) (c)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-3":{"id":"ex-3A01-3","chapter":"3A01","number":3,"title":"像的大小和方向","question":"<p>身高 1.4 m 的女孩站在平面鏡前 1 m 的位置。她穿着右圖所示的衣服。</p><p>(a) 女孩的像與鏡子的距離是多少？</p><p>(b) 求女孩的像的高度。</p><p>(c) 如果女孩走向鏡子，她的像的大小會有甚麼改變？試簡單解釋。</p><p>(d) 草繪女孩所見的衣服的像。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/3a318300bfdaef72f5f24ac1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:125.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 像距 = 物距 = 1 m</p><p>(b) 像的高度 = 女孩的高度 = 1.4 m</p><p>(c) 像的大小沒有改變，因為它只取決於女孩的大小，而不是女孩與鏡子的距離。</p><p>(d)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/773690aa5c8619c34f5a1af1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:125.2px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,330.82889511718747,562.4491,530.1449890136719],"text":"例 題 3 像的大小和方向\r\n身高 1.4 m 的女孩站在平面鏡前 1 m 的位置。她\r\n穿着右圖所示的衣服。\r\n(a) 女孩的像與鏡子的距離是多少？\r\n(b) 求女孩的像的高度。\r\n(c) 如果女孩走向鏡子，她的像的大小會有甚麼改\r\n變？試簡單解釋。\r\n(d) 草繪女孩所見的衣服的像。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,530.1449890136719,562.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 像距 = 物距 = 1 m\r\n(b) 像的高度 = 女孩的高度 = 1.4 m\r\n(c) 像的大小沒有改變，因為它只取決於女孩的大小，而不是女孩與\r\n鏡子的距離。\r\n(d) \r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-4":{"id":"ex-3A01-4","chapter":"3A01","number":4,"title":"像的位置","question":"<p>物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於平面鏡前。找出下列情況中，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的像在哪處出現，並據此畫出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的像。</p><p>(a) (b)</p><p>平面鏡</p><p>Y X</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/eab00515e0517409e0707c84.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:537.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/7dd325f867ce4575b38d27b7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:537.1px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>繪圖</p><p>繪畫鏡子所成的像</p><p>1 從物體的一個端點畫一條虛線，垂直穿過鏡面。</p><p>2 應用像距 = 物距，</p><p>確定該端點的像的位置。</p><p>3 確定物體另一端點的像的位置。用虛線箭嘴連接兩個像點，畫出物體的像。</p><p>提示</p><p>鏡面傾斜 45° 時，水平物體的像是鉛直的，反之亦然。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,104.01189511718746,562.6491,359.0735778808594],"text":"例 題 4 像的位置\r\n物體 XY 置於平面鏡前。找出下列情況中，X 點和 Y 點的像在哪處出\r\n現，並據此畫出 XY 的像。\r\n(a) (b)\r\nX\r\nY\r\n平面鏡 Y X\r\n平面鏡\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,359.0735778808594,562.6491,556.2138951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) (b)\r\nX\r\nY\r\n平面鏡\r\nX 的像\r\nY 的像\r\nY X\r\n平面鏡 Y 的像\r\nX 的像\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"tips","box":[40,100.01189511718746,181.6491,556.2138951171875],"text":"繪畫平面鏡的成像\r\n1 從物體的一個端點畫\r\n一條虛線，垂直穿過\r\n鏡子。\r\n2 應用像距 = 物距這\r\n個性質，標示該端點\r\n的像所在的位置。\r\n3 找出物體另一端點的\r\n像 所 在 的 位 置，再\r\n以虛線箭號連接這兩\r\n個像點，以畫出整個\r\n像。\r\n技巧分析\r\n描繪圖像\r\n技巧分析\r\n提提你\r\n如果鏡子沿45° 斜向擺放，\r\n水平物體就會生成垂直的\r\n像，反之亦然。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-5":{"id":"ex-3A01-5","chapter":"3A01","number":5,"title":"誰能看見像？","question":"<p>物點 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於平面鏡前，學生 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 能否看到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的像？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/15c7eb6a704476b53eef9bba.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:217.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 能看到像，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 卻看不到。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/fbda254c4f8954f5c39dda6c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:217.8px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>I 的位置與觀察者的位置無關。</p>","think":"<p>C 應向哪個方向移動，才能看見 I？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>C 可在圖中向上、朝 B 移動，直至連接 C 與像 I 的直線通過鏡子的反射部分。換言之，C 必須進入由 I 通過鏡子兩端所畫光線圍成的可見區域。向右移動足夠距離、遠離鏡子，也是進入此區域的另一條可行路徑。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,258.68145751953125],"text":"例 題 5 誰能看見像？\r\n物點 O 置於平面鏡前，學生 A、B 和 C 能否看到 O 的像？\r\nA\r\nC\r\nO\r\nB\r\n平面鏡\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,258.68145751953125,562.4491,445.0838951171875],"text":"題 解\r\nA\r\nC\r\nI O\r\nB\r\n平面鏡\r\n∴ A 和 B 能看到像，C 卻看不到。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,445.0838951171875],"text":"提提你\r\nI 的位置不受觀察者的位置\r\n影響。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[182.4488,434.5339951171875,565.4488,507.2479951171875],"text":"想一想\r\nC 應向哪個方向移動才能看到 I？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-6":{"id":"ex-3A01-6","chapter":"3A01","number":6,"title":"連身鏡的位置","question":"<p>女孩身高 78 cm，眼睛在頭頂以下 8 cm。她站在垂直平面鏡前 60 cm 的位置（圖 a），便剛好能在鏡子的底部看到自己的雙腳（圖 b）。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>(a) 鏡子底部與地面相距多遠？</p><p>(b) 如果女孩能在鏡中剛好看到自己的全身，鏡子的長度最小是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/31a1397f5a29e5ab1dbee390.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:504.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b4c9cb72f1f4887fa1061b12.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:537.4px\"></p><p>根據相似三角形，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 35 cm</p><p>鏡子底邊離地 35 cm。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/4eaaa2321d7448dc64eda4c3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:537.4px\"></p><p>根據相似三角形，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 39 cm</p><p>鏡子的最小長度為 39 cm。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":18,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,305.5193786621094],"text":"例 題 6 連身鏡的位置\r\n女孩身高78 cm，眼睛在頭頂以下8 cm。她站在垂直平面鏡前60 cm\r\n的位置（圖 a），便剛好能在鏡子的底部看到自己的雙腳（圖 b）。\r\n圖 a 圖 b 60 cm\r\n78 cm\r\n平面鏡\r\n(a) 鏡子底部與地面相距多遠？\r\n(b) 如果女孩能在鏡中剛好看到自己的全身，鏡子的長度最小是多少？\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,305.5193786621094,557.4491,748.0558951171874],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) \r\nH\r\n70 cm\r\n60 cm 60 cm\r\n70 cm\r\nH\r\n60 cm 60 cm\r\n根據相似三角形，\r\n H\r\n70 = 60\r\n60 + 60 = 1\r\n2\r\n H = 35 cm\r\n鏡子底部與地面相距 35 cm。\r\n(b) \r\nL\r\n60 cm 60 cm\r\n78 cm\r\nL\r\n78 cm\r\n60 cm 60 cm\r\n根據相似三角形，\r\n L\r\n78 = 60\r\n60 + 60 = 1\r\n2\r\n L = 39 cm\r\n鏡子的長度最小是 39 cm。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A01-7":{"id":"ex-3A01-7","chapter":"3A01","number":7,"title":"在平面鏡前行走","question":"<p>家輝站在垂直的平面鏡前，在鏡中看不見自己的鞋子，也看不見<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點。如果他走向鏡子，</p><p>(a) 他可以在鏡中看到自己的鞋子嗎？</p><p>(b) 他可以在鏡中看到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點嗎？</p><p>X</p><p>平面鏡</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/aaa6129f0158284177db8ef9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:318.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>他即使走向鏡子，也只能在鏡子底端看到身上同一部位，所以看不到鞋子。</p><p>(b)</p><p>他向着鏡子走到某一位置後，可以在鏡中看到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/1386194f82c6e1fe900f2a86.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:319.6px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/4efb67d75c4485169aafa477.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:318.7px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A01_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"b638390ebcde6ec2336af0770cb3c2900815d03c04558ba850210ce6a1df4452","segments":[{"page":20,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,326.6551818847656],"text":"例 題 7 在平面鏡前行走\r\n家輝站在垂直的平面鏡前，在鏡中看不見自己的鞋子，也看不見\r\nX 點。如果他走向鏡子，\r\n(a) 他可以在鏡中看到自己的鞋子嗎？\r\n(b) 他可以在鏡中看到 X 點嗎？\r\n平面鏡\r\nX\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,326.6551818847656,557.4491,748.4738951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) \r\n平面鏡\r\n他即使走向鏡子，也只能在鏡子底端看到身上同一部位，所以看\r\n不到鞋子。\r\n(b) \r\nX\r\n平面鏡\r\n他向着鏡子走到某一位置後，可以在鏡中看到 X 點。\r\n單元練習 1.2 Q8 (p.25)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}